7.3. Effect of Termination.  Upon termination you must immediately cease all Production Use of the Enterprise Features and cease all other use not permitted by an open-source license. Sections 3.3, 3.4, 3.5, 4.4, 4.7, 6, 8, 9 and 10, and any provision that by its nature should survive, survive termination.
7.4. No Effect on Your Agreement.  Termination of this License does not of itself terminate Your Agreement, and termination of Your Agreement does not of itself terminate this License; each is governed by its own terms.

